@title EPISODE 03 • PARTNER DRILLS
@bg track_stadium_day
@show diggy
Holloway pairs distance with sprints for "cross-training." Everyone knows it's punishment.
Diggy: You pace like you got somewhere to be.
London: I do. Ahead of you.
Diggy: In a 200? Sterling, I'd lap you twice and come back for my water.
> [Bold] "Race me. 300 meters. Middle ground." -> r_bold
> [Sweet] "Then teach me your start." -> r_sweet
> [Bitchy] "Talk is cheap. Like your spikes." -> r_bitchy
> [Good] "Let's just do the drill." -> r_good
*r_bold
@add Diggy_Affection 2
@add Team_Reputation 1
The whole team stops to watch. Diggy wins by a step. London makes him earn it.
Diggy: (breathing hard) Okay. Okay. You're fast.
London: I know.
@jump r_done
*r_sweet
@add Diggy_Affection 1
@add Diggy_Trust 2
He shows her his block start. Hands close, voice low, very serious. For four seconds she forgets to be mean.
@jump r_done
*r_bitchy
@add Diggy_Trust -2
@add Team_Reputation -1
His jaw goes tight. Maggie whistles low from the shot put ring.
Diggy: They're my brother's old spikes. But go off.
London feels about two inches tall and refuses to show it.
@jump r_done
*r_good
@add Coach_Respect 2
Holloway: Look at that. Sterling following directions. Somebody take a picture.
*r_done
@bg cafeteria
@show maggie
Maggie: So. You and the sprinter.
London: There is no "me and the sprinter."
Maggie: There's a whole team group chat about it. Cassie made a poll.
London: What are the options?
Maggie: "Hate," "secretly in love," and "fighting at Regionals."
> [Bitchy] "Tell Cassie to get a hobby." -> m_bitchy
> [Sweet] "...What's winning?" -> m_sweet
> [Good] "Mute it. I'm here to run." -> m_good
